  data: {
    LLM: "Watch the Widow! If someone takes a card you needed, you know what they are building. Don't knock unless you have at least a Flush or a high Pair.\n\nThe Defensive Swap: If there is a high card in the Widow (e.g., Ace of Spades) that doesn't help you, but you know the player next to you is collecting Spades, take it anyway to block them.\n\nThe Fake Knock: If playing the betting version, knock early with a mediocre hand to panic opponents into making sub-optimal swaps, forcing them to break potential hands.",
    Player: "Watch the Widow! If someone takes a card you needed, you know what they are building. Don't knock unless you have at least a Flush or a high Pair.\n\nThe Defensive Swap: If there is a high card in the Widow (e.g., Ace of Spades) that doesn't help you, but you know the player next to you is collecting Spades, take it anyway to block them.\n\nThe Fake Knock: If playing the betting version, knock early with a mediocre hand to panic opponents into making sub-optimal swaps, forcing them to break potential hands.",
